"answer": "Here is a summary of the emails regarding Project Zenith:\n\n*   **Project Introduction & Leadership:** Project Zenith is a new initiative focused on data analytics, cloud storage optimization, and AI-enhanced data visualization. Initial emails mention different leads (Sarah Tan, Marcus Cole) and kick-off dates (June 15, July 15, Q3 2023), indicating evolving planning stages. A later email mentions a \"grand opening\" of a Project Zenith store on 12/12/2024.\n*   **Budget:** The initial budget was $500,000 for phase one. This was later adjusted to $550,000 due to unforeseen expenses. Additionally, a separate $15,000 budget was approved for training programs for the coding team and project managers.\n*   **Timeline & Milestones:** The project has reached its first major milestone ahead of schedule, with a successful prototype test for secure file sharing. The next phase involves UI enhancements starting in October. Feedback on the prototype is being sought by the end of November. Security protocol updates (MFA, encryption) are effective from January next year.\n*   **Current Activities:** The team is currently gathering innovative ideas, particularly from R&D, with a submission deadline of July 20th. There are also early-stage discussions regarding a potential partnership with TechInnovate to leverage their AI technology."
